# NEWXAU Project Rule

NEWXAU is an XAUUSD signal recommendation, backtesting, paper-trading, and guarded Capital.com execution system.

Before editing:

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/ai/README.md`, `docs/ai/CURRENT_STATE.md`, and `docs/ai/HANDOFF.md`.
- Read only task-relevant extra docs and skills.
- Inspect `git status --short --branch`.

Rules:

- Keep changes minimal and scoped; preserve pipeline boundaries and XAUUSD defaults.
- Preserve PostgreSQL-to-memory fallback and Vanilla JS dashboard compatibility.
- Never expose secrets or broker sessions.
- Do not edit `vendor/Kronos` unless explicitly requested.
- Do not alter model artifacts, datasets, runtime state, or generated exports unless specifically required.

After meaningful changes:

- Run relevant safe verification.
- Update `docs/ai/TASK_LOG.md` and only memory files whose facts changed.
- Update `docs/ai/HANDOFF.md` if work is paused or transferred.
- Run `node scripts/ai-memory/check-memory.mjs`.
